{"audio":{"src":"https://pub-13abeb101e2945d2a7f60234f6faf52e.r2.dev/materials/a2-grand-theft-auto-vi-vice-city-lucia-and-jason/audio/main-b57c2906729b.mp3","durationSec":234.288,"cues":[{"start":0,"end":4.12,"text":"Grand Theft Auto VI belongs to the Grand Theft Auto series."},{"start":4.84,"end":8.2,"text":"A series is a group of games with the same main name."},{"start":8.82,"end":10.98,"text":"This is the eighth main game in the series."},{"start":11.7,"end":15.82,"text":"It follows Grand Theft Auto V, which came out in 2013."},{"start":17,"end":19.98,"text":"Rockstar Games makes and publishes the new game."},{"start":20.72,"end":23.86,"text":"This means it creates the game and brings it to players."},{"start":24.78,"end":27.84,"text":"Rockstar Games is an American video game company."},{"start":27.84,"end":32.18,"text":"It started in 1998 and is based in New York City."},{"start":33.08,"end":36.42,"text":"The company is also known for the Red Dead Redemption series."},{"start":36.42,"end":39.58,"text":"The game takes place in Leonida."},{"start":39.58,"end":44.08,"text":"Leonida is a made-up US state based on Florida."},{"start":45,"end":49.42,"text":"“Based on” means that a real place gives ideas for a made-up place."},{"start":49.42,"end":53.08,"text":"Leonida is not another name for the real state."},{"start":53.58,"end":55.64,"text":"The game's world includes Vice City."},{"start":55.64,"end":60.24,"text":"This made-up city is based on Miami, a real city in Florida."},{"start":61.06,"end":63.5,"text":"Think of these places at two different sizes."},{"start":63.5,"end":68.4,"text":"Leonida is the state, and Vice City is a city inside it."},{"start":68.86,"end":70.44,"text":"The game has an open world."},{"start":71.06,"end":75.14,"text":"Players can explore its setting rather than only follow one fixed path."},{"start":75.84,"end":79.9,"text":"The two main characters are Lucia Caminos and Jason Duval."},{"start":80.6,"end":83.48,"text":"Main characters are the people at the centre of a story."},{"start":83.48,"end":88.16,"text":"Their names often become important when people talk about a game."},{"start":88.16,"end":93.14,"text":"Lucia is the Grand Theft Auto series' first main female character."},{"start":93.88,"end":101.2,"text":"The new game has two main characters, while Grand Theft Auto V has three: Michael, Franklin and Trevor."},{"start":102.02,"end":104.76,"text":"This gives us one clear difference between the games."},{"start":105.58,"end":108.66,"text":"Grand Theft Auto VI is also a single-player game."},{"start":108.66,"end":113.74,"text":"That means one person plays, even though the story has two main characters."},{"start":113.74,"end":119.78,"text":"Grand Theft Auto V is set in Los Santos, a city based on Los Angeles."},{"start":120.64,"end":125.4,"text":"Grand Theft Auto VI changes the setting to Leonida and Vice City."},{"start":126.18,"end":131.46,"text":"Its map is reported to be three times larger than the area in Red Dead Redemption 2."},{"start":132.06,"end":136.58,"text":"This size comparison is with that game, not with Grand Theft Auto V."},{"start":136.58,"end":141.46,"text":"Activities include skydiving, basketball and scuba diving."},{"start":142.26,"end":145.96,"text":"There is also a phone social media app called Snapmatic."},{"start":146.68,"end":152.04,"text":"The radio offers pop, country, hip-hop and Latin music, plus podcasts."},{"start":152.98,"end":157.14,"text":"These features give players different things to do and hear while exploring."},{"start":157.88,"end":162.18,"text":"A trailer is a short video that gives people an early look at a game."},{"start":162.18,"end":167.18,"text":"Grand Theft Auto VI's first trailer came out in December 2023."},{"start":168.36,"end":170.86,"text":"The second came out in May 2025."},{"start":171.82,"end":174.36,"text":"Both appeared before the game's planned release."},{"start":175.18,"end":180.64,"text":"The second trailer received a record 475 million views in 24 hours."},{"start":181.22,"end":183.98,"text":"That is almost half a billion views in one day."},{"start":184.5,"end":188.48,"text":"The number describes views, not the number of different people who watched."},{"start":188.48,"end":191.88,"text":"A view count shows how often a video was watched."},{"start":192.38,"end":195.16,"text":"It does not tell us what every viewer thought about it."},{"start":195.84,"end":200.86,"text":"Grand Theft Auto VI is due to come out on 19 November 2026."},{"start":201.68,"end":204.38,"text":"Rockstar Games' official page gives this date."},{"start":204.94,"end":206.34,"text":"The game was delayed twice."},{"start":206.9,"end":210.2,"text":"A delay means that something happens later than first planned."},{"start":210.82,"end":215.3,"text":"The announced platforms are PlayStation 5 and Xbox Series X|S."},{"start":215.3,"end":218.48,"text":"A platform is the system that a game runs on."},{"start":219.26,"end":220.74,"text":"Here, these are game consoles."},{"start":221.46,"end":223.58,"text":"No PC version has been announced."},{"start":224,"end":227.6,"text":"That is different from saying a PC version will never exist."},{"start":228.18,"end":233.74,"text":"For now, the announced release is for those consoles, and the release date is still in the future."}],"words":[{"text":"Grand","start":0,"end":0.66},{"text":"Theft","start":0.66,"end":0.88},{"text":"Auto","start":0.88,"end":1.34},{"text":"VI","start":1.34,"end":1.74},{"text":"belongs","start":1.74,"end":2.3},{"text":"to","start":2.3,"end":2.7},{"text":"the","start":2.7,"end":2.82},{"text":"Grand","start":2.82,"end":3.14},{"text":"Theft","start":3.14,"end":3.4},{"text":"Auto","start":3.4,"end":3.74},{"text":"series","start":3.74,"end":4.12},{"text":"A","start":4.84,"end":5},{"text":"series","start":5,"end":5.3},{"text":"is","start":5.3,"end":5.76},{"text":"a","start":5.76,"end":5.92},{"text":"group","start":5.92,"end":6.12},{"text":"of","start":6.12,"end":6.4},{"text